Larry: Farming Runs
-------------------
https://github.com/agrahamlincoln/larry-farming-runs-plugin

The farming patch state table (src/main/resources/com/herbrunhelper/patch-states.tsv) and the
patch regions and varbit ids in FarmPatch.java come from Larry's data files. Ideas borrowed
from Larry: per-stop work lists, finished stops dropping off, bank stops when a run won't fit
in one inventory, and learning the account's farming tick offset.

